The bug is caused by a race condition during the shutdown of the `CoreContainer`, where cores could still be accessed or handed out to requests while they are being closed. This occurs because the original implementation holds locks on the core lists while attempting to shut them down, leading to potential inconsistencies and errors if a core is accessed concurrently during this process.

